<Selected><T>Bool</T><D>0</D></Selected>
<Text>&lt;P class=MsoTitle style=&quot;BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 0.75pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1pt; PADDING-TOP: 0in; PADDING-LEFT: 0in; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 0in&quot; align=center&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;FONT size=5 face=Arial&gt;SParamPhaseShifterAtten&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot; align=center&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt&quot;&gt;Keysight Technologies Example Workspace&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot; align=center&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;FONT size=2&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;FONT color=#ff0000 size=2&gt;&lt;FONT color=#000000&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;This workspace demonstrates use of S-parameter data in the Phased Array Attenuator (ArrayAttn) and Phase Shifter (ArrayPhase) models.&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;It is similar to the workspace &lt;EM&gt;SParamDatasetPhaseShifterAtten&lt;/EM&gt; but it reads the S-parameter data directly from the disk, so it is missing the folders with the imported S-parameter data. &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;FONT color=#ff0000&gt;Make sure you unzip the files &lt;EM&gt;HMC543ALC4B-s-parameters.zip&lt;/EM&gt; and &lt;EM&gt;HMC1019ALP4E-sparameters.zip&lt;/EM&gt; before you run any simulations. It is recommended that you first copy this workspace and the above zip files to a directory where you have write access.&lt;/FONT&gt; The zip file contain &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;S-parameter data for the Analog Devices parts HMC1019ALP4E (5-bit Digital Attenuator) and HMC543ALC4B (4-bit Digital Phase Shifter). The S-parameter data is for each state of these devices (32 states for Attenuator and&amp;nbsp;16 states for Phase Shifter).&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;Since the workspace was saved without simulation data, you may see errors from equations or graphs trying to access datasets from simulations that have not run yet. These errors will go away once you run all simulations in this workspace.&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;B&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;SETUP&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/B&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: red; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;?xml:namespace prefix = &quot;o&quot; ns = &quot;urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office&quot; /&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;The &lt;EM&gt;Designs&lt;/EM&gt; folder has three designs&amp;nbsp;representing (at different levels of accuracy/detail) an 8 x 8 URA system with element spacing set to half a wavelength&amp;nbsp;for a 10 GHz wave (see &lt;EM&gt;Equation1&lt;/EM&gt;)&amp;nbsp;using a Taylor window and pointing the beam at Theta = 25 degrees and Phi = 250 degrees.&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;UL&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;LI&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;DIV class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;EM&gt;DesignIdeal &lt;/EM&gt;is using an ideal attenuator and phase shifter&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/DIV&gt;&lt;/LI&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;LI&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;DIV class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;DIV class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;EM&gt;DesignQuant &lt;/EM&gt;is using a 5-bit&amp;nbsp;attenuator and a 4-bit phase shifter, whose response is frequency independent&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/DIV&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/DIV&gt;&lt;/LI&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;LI&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;DIV class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;DIV class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;DIV class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;EM&gt;DesignQuantSParams &lt;/EM&gt;is using a 5-bit&amp;nbsp;attenuator and a 4-bit phase shifter, which also use the S-parameter data for the Analog Devices parts described above.&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/DIV&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/DIV&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/DIV&gt;&lt;/LI&gt;&lt;/UL&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: red; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;The graphs under the &lt;EM&gt;Graphs&lt;/EM&gt; folder compare the attenuations and phase shifts introduced by the ArrayAttn and ArrayPhase in the three designs&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;UL&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;LI&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;DIV class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: red; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;EM&gt;Attenuation_ArrayAttn1 &lt;/EM&gt;compares the attenuation introduced by the ArrayAttn model in the three designs&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/DIV&gt;&lt;/LI&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;LI&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;DIV class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: red; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;DIV class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: red; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;EM&gt;Attenuation_ArrayPhase1 &lt;/EM&gt;shows the attenuation introduced by the ArrayPhase&amp;nbsp;model in &lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;EM&gt;DesignQuantSParams&lt;/EM&gt;. This attenuation should not vary too much, otherwise the taper introduced by ArrayAttn could be distorted and the desired sidelobe level may not be achieved. ArrayPhase DOES NOT introduce any attenuation in designs &lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;EM&gt;DesignIdeal &lt;/EM&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;and &lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;EM&gt;DesignQuant. &lt;/EM&gt;Even if the &lt;EM&gt;InsertionLoss&lt;/EM&gt; parameter is set to 1, the insertion loos would be the same for all paths and would not distort the taper&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/DIV&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/DIV&gt;&lt;/LI&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;LI&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;DIV class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: red; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;DIV class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: red; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;DIV class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: red; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;EM&gt;PhaseShift_ArrayPhase1 &lt;/EM&gt;compares the phase shift introduced by the ArrayPhase model in the three designs&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/DIV&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/DIV&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/DIV&gt;&lt;/LI&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;LI&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;DIV class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: red; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;DIV class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: red; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;DIV class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: red; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: red; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;EM&gt;PhaseShift_ArrayAttn1&lt;/EM&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;EM&gt; &lt;/EM&gt;shows the phase shift introduced by the ArrayAttn&amp;nbsp;model in &lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;EM&gt;DesignQuantSParams&lt;/EM&gt;. This phase shift should not vary too much, otherwise the phase shifts introduced by ArrayPhase&amp;nbsp;could be distorted and the beam may not end up pointing to the desired direction. ArrayAttn DOES NOT introduce any phase shift in designs &lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;EM&gt;DesignIdeal &lt;/EM&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;and &lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;EM&gt;DesignQuant.&lt;/EM&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/DIV&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/DIV&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/DIV&gt;&lt;/LI&gt;&lt;/UL&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;Equation &lt;EM&gt;PlotPatterns&lt;/EM&gt; creates 3-D beam patterns for the three designs so that we can compare the effects of quantization and S-parameters.&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;B&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;EXERCISES&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/B&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: red; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;B&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/B&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;Run all three Phased Array anlyses.&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;Observe the attenuations and phase shifts introduced by ArrayAttn and ArrayPhase in the three designs (graphs in &lt;EM&gt;Graphs&lt;/EM&gt; folder).&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;Run Equation &lt;EM&gt;PlotPatterns&lt;/EM&gt; to see the three beam patterns.&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;Observe the effects of quantization and S-paramters in the beam patterns.&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;Tune the Freq variable to see how the attenuations, phases shifts, and beam patterns change.&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;BR&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;</Text>
